{{!
    @template enrol_apply/review_history

    The applicant's earlier applications to this course, as the course report shows them to this
    reader: the outcome as a badge, the dates, who decided, the key group, the groups joined and
    the decision note. Never the message written to the applicant, which the report does not
    show either.

    A server-rendered region. Without JavaScript (body without jsenabled) it is shown in place in
    the left column; with it, styles.css hides it and enrol_apply/review moves the list and the
    report link into a core/modal opened from the rules' "See the history" button, which handles
    focus, Escape and focus return. So the list carries no id of its own: a copy of it lives in
    the dialogue while the region stays in the page.

    The group cells and the note arrive ESCAPED and are triple stashed: the group names come out
    of the report's own formatters, which escape each name once and leave a cell empty for a
    group this reader may not see, and the note out of format_text(FORMAT_PLAIN), which keeps its
    line breaks.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hashistory boolean - whether this reader holds enrol/apply:viewreports AND there is history
    * historylabel string - the list's heading, and the dialogue's title
    * historydeciderlabel, historykeygrouplabel, historyjoinedlabel, historynotelabel string
    * hasreportlink boolean - whether this reader can open the course report (capability AND course access)
    * historyreportlabel string, historyreporturl string - the link to the course report
    * history array - one entry per earlier application, newest first, each with outcome (plain),
      outcomeclass (a literal background and text colour pair), applied, hasdecided, decided,
      hasfacts (any of the four below), hasdecider, decider (plain), haskeygroup, keygroup (escaped), hasjoined, joined (escaped),
      hasnote and note (escaped)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hashistory": true,
        "historylabel": "Earlier applications to this course",
        "historydeciderlabel": "Decided by",
        "historykeygrouplabel": "Group of the enrolment key",
        "historyjoinedlabel": "Groups joined",
        "historynotelabel": "Note for the record",
        "hasreportlink": true,
        "historyreportlabel": "Open the applications report",
        "historyreporturl": "https://example.com/enrol/apply/report.php?id=7",
        "history": [
            {
                "outcome": "Cancelled", "outcomeclass": "bg-danger text-white", "applied": "Applied on 12/03/26, 09:14",
                "hasdecided": true, "decided": "decided on 14/03/26, 10:02", "hasfacts": true, "hasdecider": true, "decider": "Carlos Lima",
                "haskeygroup": true, "keygroup": "Turma B", "hasjoined": false, "joined": "",
                "hasnote": true, "note": "Documents missing."
            }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#hashistory}}
<section class="enrol_apply-historyregion" id="enrol_apply_review_history" aria-labelledby="enrol_apply_review_history_heading">
    <h2 class="enrol_apply-blocktitle" id="enrol_apply_review_history_heading" data-region="history-title">{{historylabel}}</h2>
    <ol class="enrol_apply-timeline list-unstyled mb-0" data-region="history-list">
        {{#history}}
            <li>
                <div class="enrol_apply-timelinehead">
                    <span class="badge {{outcomeclass}}">{{outcome}}</span>
                    <span class="enrol_apply-timelinedate">{{applied}}{{#hasdecided}} · {{decided}}{{/hasdecided}}</span>
                </div>
                {{#hasfacts}}
                    <dl class="enrol_apply-historyfacts mb-0">
                        {{#hasdecider}}<div><dt>{{historydeciderlabel}}</dt><dd>{{decider}}</dd></div>{{/hasdecider}}
                        {{#haskeygroup}}<div><dt>{{historykeygrouplabel}}</dt><dd>{{{keygroup}}}</dd></div>{{/haskeygroup}}
                        {{#hasjoined}}<div><dt>{{historyjoinedlabel}}</dt><dd>{{{joined}}}</dd></div>{{/hasjoined}}
                        {{#hasnote}}<div><dt>{{historynotelabel}}</dt><dd>{{{note}}}</dd></div>{{/hasnote}}
                    </dl>
                {{/hasfacts}}
            </li>
        {{/history}}
    </ol>
    {{#hasreportlink}}
        <p class="enrol_apply-historyreport mb-0" data-region="history-footer"><a href="{{historyreporturl}}">{{historyreportlabel}}</a></p>
    {{/hasreportlink}}
</section>
{{/hashistory}}
